
### 3. Create `.gitignore` (in the **root** of your repo, next to `.git`)
*(This prevents you from accidentally committing build files, IDE settings, or compiled binaries to GitHub. If you already have one in the root, just add these lines to it).*

```gitignore
# Build artifacts
build/
out/
bin/
obj/

# Coverage files
*.gcno
*.gcda
coverage.info
coverage_report/
*.profraw
*.profdata

# IDE and OS files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile